{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/a93e5efe0f9933103156b74a3c6609f4.poster.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/a93e5efe0f9933103156b74a3c6609f4.webm?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/a93e5efe0f9933103156b74a3c6609f4.mp4?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/3fa2511e6c566d4267ad4159b7f2f732.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would happen if both pilots had to control each side of the spaceship simultaneously? That\u2019s what Stupid Spaceships has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your (Reliable) friend have to work together to steer your (stupid) spaceship and reach the goal before the death cloud, or whatever is chasing you, catches you and destroy your ship (along with you and your friend)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/05a9aa8fb8cb2afaf7bfad0000d4efb0.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/ac4f2a00786ccec53cada216bbb621a9.poster.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/ac4f2a00786ccec53cada216bbb621a9.webm?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/ac4f2a00786ccec53cada216bbb621a9.mp4?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 thrusters on each ship. Each player has control over 2 thrusters (or all 4 if you play alone) one of them is always active but you can switch the active thruster to the another one you have in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/a859da792f474c3487c784dbae917c53.poster.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/a859da792f474c3487c784dbae917c53.webm?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/a859da792f474c3487c784dbae917c53.mp4?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you gotta go fast, because the death cloud, or whatever wants you dead, will try catching up to you and if it does, Game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/5f3bd037a5b2f30b95495c00195a99d8.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/edb395d67ca9286634d4d9e0a1d48ebb.poster.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/edb395d67ca9286634d4d9e0a1d48ebb.webm?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/edb395d67ca9286634d4d9e0a1d48ebb.mp4?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey through the deadly space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is dangerous and everything out there wants you dead. Journey through 4 Unique Chapters (17 levels in total!!!) and face plenty of fearsome hazard</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly asteroid belt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The swarm of space beast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bounty hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/d375a73c67cbfc27e2e40cca5737f2f5.poster.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/d375a73c67cbfc27e2e40cca5737f2f5.webm?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/d375a73c67cbfc27e2e40cca5737f2f5.mp4?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything wants you dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 10+ unique perilous obstacles such as an inflatable bio spike, the laser turret, Homing missile and more!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/df5a42ef4507775fdcb18d08a0597b60.poster.avif?t=1765978879\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/df5a42ef4507775fdcb18d08a0597b60.webm?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/extras/df5a42ef4507775fdcb18d08a0597b60.mp4?t=1765978879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock new (stupid) spaceships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn stars from completing level and unlock even more (stupid) spaceships, each ship plays differently so replaying the same level won\u2019t feel the same!! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is just the beginning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More chapters and spaceships along with plenty of improvements will be added to the game in the future so stay tuned!!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124000?t=1765978879","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/c5b1d4c296ece83db9bbad331f4f9418a656c61f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765978879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/cdc5362e2d9c9527a54a305e6632ed8cb55121eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765978879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124000/cdc5362e2d9c9527a54a305e6632ed8cb55121eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765978879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Spli